    ns1:nextSentence ns1:Sentence_0_58 ;
    ns1:previousSentence ns1:Sentence_0_56 ;
    ns1:senttext "The Greek socialist party s executive bureau gave the green light to Prime Minister Costas Simitis to call snap elections , its general secretary Costas Skandalidis told reporters ." .

